Khalbali Guitar Chords from the movie 3G sung by Arijit Singh, Shilpa Rao and Tochi Raina.

Female Lead:

[Cm]Aarzooein sang lekar [D#]khwab phir jode

[Fm]thaame tera yaar daaman [G#]yaar daaman [A#]phir se

Male Lead:

[Cm] gaye bhool jo lamhe woh [D#]dard ke pal thhe

beh [Fm]tar ab din ho kal [G#]ke.. kal [A#]ke..

kis [Cm]tarah se tera ab [D#]shukar adaa ho

teri [Fm]nazr-o-karam ke [G#]sadke [A#]sadke- [2 times]

[Cm]Aarzooein [A#]sang lekar [Fm]khwaab phir jo [A#]de

[Cm]thaamey tera [A#]yaar daaman

[G#]tedhe-medhe raston pe [Gm]sang mere rehna [Cm]yunhi

{c: Chorus}

[Cm]Khalbali hai khalbali hai [D#]dil vich khalbali....

[Fm]khalbali hai khalbali hai [G#]dil vich khal [A#]bali....Female Lead:

[D#]Ho mauje, [A#]bahaarein, ho [G7]rehmatein [Cm]hazaar

[G#]shaamein ho [A#]jaise tyo [D#]haar

[D#]Raunak, [A#]nazaarein, ho [G7]barqatein [Cm]hazaar

[G#]subah ho [A#]tera dee [D#]daar

[Cm]tujhse hi mere [D#]shaam-o-sehar hain

[Fm]zaahir hui baat [A#]ye..[G#]ye..[Cm]

Khalbali hai khalbali part repeat

Male Lead:

Ho [A#]hai teri hi sangat mein moha [Cm]bbat ka mausam

[A#]Hai tu hi hai maushiqui, tu [Cm]ulfat ki sargam

teri [A#]baaton mein [Fm]hai, hai [Gm]saanse re [Cm]sham

teri [G#]aankhen [Gm]sukoon tera [A#]choona mar [Cm]ham

Rest of the song is same

(G7-320001)
